{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:alarmHeadlineConfirmed", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "alarmHeadlineConfirmed", "text": "The band has this alarm", "sha256": "154b08f68df49aff48ce089e720f51043aac4ca6c5e94139080c637ded5385a2", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:alarmHeadlinePending", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "alarmHeadlinePending", "text": "Sent — waiting for the band to confirm", "sha256": "a9bf142c292cd27e27a288de7383606d20eab589e7808799067fdb71a901733c", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:alarmHeadlineUnknown", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "alarmHeadlineUnknown", "text": "We cannot tell whether this will fire", "sha256": "ca3a582159539543c71905cdd36c9b7ed7309835136d48c7f02785f566c13882", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:alarmHeadlineNone", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "alarmHeadlineNone", "text": "No alarm is set", "sha256": "289951ba8202f7bb6d2362b9127b0f0f3322d1dfbeef48d8b86adeb26d80e59c", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:alarmDetailConfirmed", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "alarmDetailConfirmed", "text": "The band reported that it latched the alarm.", "sha256": "fbf1434d0f1460edf08aa88717825f0dc6676acbce1110173496b016b9529915", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:alarmDetailPending", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "alarmDetailPending", "text": "The write reached the band. Its confirmation usually arrives within a few seconds.", "sha256": "240ae3d3643dc00caea89b7bb3c25cd1038dacb86a72e02a82b70e8182e93d52", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:alarmDetailUnknown", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "alarmDetailUnknown", "text": "The time above is what this app last sent. The band never confirmed it — or it was set in an earlier run of the app, and there is no way to ask the band what it is holding. Set it again while connected if you need to be sure.", "sha256": "5f636fcbc5920a90fb48a759fa3564ca6303900262bc6cc6f45d5fdc13c0c7cc", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:bandNotifNavTitle", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "bandNotifNavTitle", "text": "Band notifications", "sha256": "bd4688528589d7688c43d0d50057769ac7eae1cbe1f9657f645028444253a74f", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:bandNotifNavSub", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "bandNotifNavSub", "text": "WHAT MAKES THE STRAP BUZZ", "sha256": "ccbbca5d590f314bfe9b7b62c01b645463334cd3849346b8da7a740820283aca", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:bandNotifUnsupportedTitle", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "bandNotifUnsupportedTitle", "text": "This phone cannot do it", "sha256": "552ee289028076860b9f624548e88101f05e75527edda320185452f823c23d38", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:bandNotifUnsupportedBody", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "bandNotifUnsupportedBody", "text": "Reading which app posted a notification is an Android capability. iOS gives no app that access, including this one.", "sha256": "be6186d3a3b411cf1225320a29aba0afc95582c62a70ced4f56c9d298811a033", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:bandNotifRelayGroup", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "bandNotifRelayGroup", "text": "Relay", "sha256": "c226b0485361a7d12f677de5fd6d094fce775723bed9f5cb44000056b45636fc", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:bandNotifBuzzOnAppNotifs", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "bandNotifBuzzOnAppNotifs", "text": "Buzz on app notifications", "sha256": "593029e4ab38c87792f097a7df01462b0900bcdcfa77f815afb3248075efa31c", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:bandNotifBuzzSub", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "bandNotifBuzzSub", "text": "The strap buzzes when one of the apps below notifies you. What a notification says is never read or sent — only which app posted, kept on this phone to build the list", "sha256": "048c4268fc11163b8b471c7a2de026a6bbb0ac461fb29133bd603bb4053a71ee", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:bandNotifAppsArmed", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "bandNotifAppsArmed", "text": "Apps armed", "sha256": "4609ede9236196ebcd62c7a800e41aaaa6d8acc4752a0149e735f408928cfee2", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:bandNotifPermissionTitle", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "bandNotifPermissionTitle", "text": "Android needs to let us see notifications", "sha256": "552443324a77e27c68e6656154357cd33bb45efd15924893eb3be3932d5be833", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:bandNotifPermissionBody", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "bandNotifPermissionBody", "text": "The permission says which app posted, and that is all this uses it for. The names stay on this phone and nothing leaves it.", "sha256": "b6195b4750e91936420cf0682d01f88ba08c22226b1c37fc27a68fa1a4846bb3", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:bandNotifGrantAccess", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "bandNotifGrantAccess", "text": "Grant notification access", "sha256": "4a3639118275eb93b8c60b73ef05aeff153553c606117f7909b95bee69adc511", "kind": "arb"}
{"id": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb:bandNotifEmptyTitle", "file": "lib/l10n/app_en.arb", "location": "bandNotifEmptyTitle", "text": "No app has notified you yet", "sha256": "a7bb7a71ac317802c54570e63f54f7e830ffa2dbb3bb8e4fa096dec927fc9c29", "kind": "arb"}
